---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
	title="Public Speaking"
	description="Jon Fleming is a member of Chinook Toastmasters in Seattle."
>
	<main id="content" class="wrap page-title">
		<h1>Public Speaking</h1>
		<div class="prose">
			<p>
				I'm a proud member of the
				<a href="https://chinook.toastmastersclubs.org/">Chinook Toastmasters Club</a> in Seattle, WA.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a href="https://www.toastmasters.org/">Toastmasters International</a> is a nonprofit
				educational organization that teaches public speaking and leadership skills through a
				worldwide network of clubs. Headquartered in Englewood, Colo., the organization's
				membership exceeds 364,000 in more than 16,800 clubs in 145 countries. Since 1924,
				Toastmasters International has helped people from diverse backgrounds become more
				confident speakers, communicators, and leaders.
			</p>
			<p>
				Everything in Toastmasters revolves around the club. With a network of 16,800 clubs across
				145 countries, you are sure to find one near you. Our club has around 20 members and meets
				Thursdays at 12:00pm for an hour, currently using Zoom.
			</p>
			<p>For a preview of what the club experience is like, watch this video:</p>
		</div>
		<div class="video">
			<iframe
				src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/383gehepo8M"
				title="A preview of the Toastmasters club experience"
				allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
				allowfullscreen></iframe>
		</div>
	</main>
</Base>
